[ 0 [ ADD ] FOLD ] 'S0D.SUM' DEF
[ [ NIL? NOT ] FILTER ] 'S0D.PRESENT' DEF
[ 'P' BIND P S0D.SUM P LENGTH DIV ] 'S0D.MEAN' DEF
[ 'V' BIND V V S0D.PRESENT 0 GET [ 'X' BIND 'A' BIND A X X NIL? SELECT ] SCAN ] 'S0D.FFILL' DEF
[ [ NIL? ] MAP 'M' BIND M [ FALSE ] M -1 DROP CONCAT NOT AND ] 'S0D.GAP-STARTS' DEF
[ 'T' BIND 1 0 T SELECT S0D.SUM ] 'S0D.COUNT-TRUE' DEF
[ 0 [ 'X' BIND 'A' BIND A 1 ADD 0 X NIL? SELECT ] SCAN 0 [ MAX ] FOLD ] 'S0D.LONGEST-GAP' DEF
[ 'V' BIND V 1 DROP V -1 DROP DIV ] 'S0D.RATIOS' DEF
[ 'V' BIND V V S0D.PRESENT 'P' BIND P P 0 GET [ MAX ] FOLD DIV ] 'S0D.SCALED' DEF
[ JSON-DECODE 'orders' GET ] 'S0D.ORDERS' DEF
[ [ 'price' HAS? ] FILTER [ 'R' BIND R 'qty' GET R 'price' GET MUL ] MAP S0D.SUM ] 'S0D.REVENUE' DEF
[ 'O' BIND O [ 'sku' GET ] MAP O [ 'qty' GET ] MAP GROUP 'G' BIND G KEYS G VALUES [ S0D.SUM ] MAP RECORD ] 'S0D.QTY-BY-SKU' DEF
[ 'T' BIND T KEYS T VALUES -1 MUL ORDER 0 GET GET ] 'S0D.ARGMAX-KEY' DEF
[ ' ' TOKENIZE [ '' EQ NOT ] FILTER ] 'S0D.WORDS' DEF
[ [ 'X' BIND ' ' X 2 COLLECT JOIN ] MAP JOIN TRIM ] 'S0D.UNWORDS' DEF
[ LOWER CHARS 'C' BIND C 0 GET UPPER 1 COLLECT C 1 DROP CONCAT JOIN ] 'S0D.TITLE-WORD' DEF
[ 3 NIL 5 1 NIL NIL 4 ] S0D.PRESENT S0D.MEAN
